@CashFlow.Transactions_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@Keycloak_TokenUrl = http://localhost:9080/realms/cashflow/protocol/openid-connect/token

### Obter token (cashflow-admin: leitura e escrita) — execute antes das demais requisições
# @name login
POST {{Keycloak_TokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=cashflow-api&client_secret=cashflow-api-secret&username=cashflow-admin&password=admin123

### Criar lançamento
POST {{CashFlow.Transactions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "type": "credit",
  "description": "Venda de produto",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-19T10:30:00Z"
}

### Listar lançamentos
GET {{CashFlow.Transactions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar lançamentos por data
GET {{CashFlow.Transactions_HostAddress}}/api/v1/transactions?date=2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{CashFlow.Transactions_HostAddress}}/health
